  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to enhance and advance water science and innovation, water education, water management, cooperation, and governance towards a water secure world in a changing environment, the Addis Ababa Liaison Office will work with Ethiopia and the AUC by 1) undertaking Baseline Study and Water Profiling in Ethiopia, 2) Strengthening IHP Committee Ethiopia and 3) Transboundary cooperation, UNESCO Regional Office &amp; AUC, ARCE.</narrative>
